    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneI_37.3/p@22877",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ANTONIO.\nTell me, Pantino, what sad talk was that\nWherewith my brother held you in the cloister?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneI_37.3/p@22877/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneI_37.3/p@22877/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 49,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneI_37.3/p@22877/line-3",
          "start": 50,
          "end": 96,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6504187,
        "end": 6504318,
        "line": 243598,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@22877",
        "anchor": "sceneI_37.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ANTONIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneI_37.3/p@23012",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PANTINO.\n’Twas of his nephew Proteus, your son.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneI_37.3/p@23012/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneI_37.3/p@23012/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 47,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6504322,
        "end": 6504399,
        "line": 243604,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@23012",
        "anchor": "sceneI_37.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PANTINO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneI_37.3/p@23093",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ANTONIO.\nWhy, what of him?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneI_37.3/p@23093/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneI_37.3/p@23093/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 26,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6504403,
        "end": 6504459,
        "line": 243609,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap37/p@23093",
        "anchor": "sceneI_37.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ANTONIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneI_37.3/p@23153",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PANTINO.\nHe wondered that your lordship\nWould suffer him to spend his youth at home\nWhile other men, of slender reputation,\nPut forth their sons to seek preferment out:\nSome to the wars to try their fortune there;\nSome to discover islands far away;\nSome to the studious universities.\nFor any or for all these exercises\nHe said that Proteus your son was meet,\nAnd did request me to importune you\nTo let him spend his time no more at home,\nWhich would be great impeachment to his age\nIn having known no travel in his youth.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-gentlemen-of-verona/sceneI_37.3/p@23153/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
